<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines' 91-day treasury bill rate down.</title>
<headline>Philippines' 91-day treasury bill rate down.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' benchmark 91-day Treasury bill rate dropped to an average of 11.495 percent at Monday's regular weekly auction from 11.570 percent in the previous week, the Bureau of Treasury reported.</p>
</text>
